              "paragraphId": "p0063",
              "text": "The Company may assign this Agreement, without HDI's consent, to an affiliate or to a successor in a merger, acquisition or sale of substantially all of its assets. HDI may not assign this Agreement without the Company's prior written consent, which shall not be unreasonably withheld, and shall never assign to a competitor of the Company. A change of control of the Company shall not give HDI any right to terminate this Agreement."
